# Search evaluation data (docs/milestones.md F1). The wiki corpus (CC BY-SA)
# and the 80-query regression bundle are tracked. The 800-query seed set and
# its 400-row gold file are not: they have known defects (docs/perf/
# f1-eval-baseline/f0_report.md) and are regenerated by
# scripts/generate_evalset_seed.py --seed 42.
example/assets/evalsets/*
!example/assets/evalsets/README.md
!example/assets/evalsets/f1/
!example/assets/evalsets/wiki_article_sources_manifest_v1.json
!example/assets/evalsets/wiki_article_sources_manifest_80_balanced_v1.json
!example/assets/evalsets/hybrid_relevance_seed_80_balanced_v1.jsonl
!example/assets/evalsets/hybrid_passage_gold_80_balanced_v1.jsonl
